12/12 tests PASS, go vet limpio. Resumen de lo entregado:

**`v3/go.mod`** — Módulo `github.com/fredyk/westack-go/v3`

**`v3/graphql/type_mapping.go`** — Funciones pures para mapear tipos Go → GraphQL:
- `GoTypeToGraphQL(v any) string` — `string→String`, `int/int64→Int`, `float→Float`, `bool→Boolean`, `time.Time→DateTime`, `[]T→[T]`, `[]float32→Vector`, structs→nombre
- `GoTypeName(t reflect.Type) string` — nombre del tipo para SDL
- `GoTypeToSDLFragment(t reflect.Type, nullable bool) string` — fragmento SDL con nullability (`String`, `String!`, `[Int]`, etc.)

**`v3/graphql/schema_helper.go`** — SchemaHelper gemelo de swaggerhelper:
- `NewSchemaHelper()` / `RegisterInputType[T](v any) string` / `RegisterOutputType[R](v any) string` — reflexión + dedupe
- `AddOperation(kind, name, inputType, resultType, desc string)` — registra Query/Mutation
- `SDL() string` — materializa el contrato SDL acumulado

**`v3/graphql/bind_operations.go`** — Firmas gemelo de BindRemoteOperation:
- `BindGraphQLOperation[T,R]`, `BindGraphQLOperationWithOptions`, `BindGraphQLOperationWithContext`
- `BindGraphQLQuery[T,R]` (get→query), `BindGraphQLMutation[T,R]` (post/put/patch→mutation)
- Stubs que registran tipos en SchemaHelper y generan SDL; sin runtime GraphQL real

**Tests** (12/12 verdes):
- `type_mapping_test.go` — 10 casos de mapeo + struct name
- `schema_helper_test.go` — Register + dedupe + AddOperation + Query vs Mutation + nested dedupe + empty SDL
- `bind_operations_test.go` — 4 stubs retornan non-nil
